{"version":1,"content":"<p>【官方回應 ⚠️】Apple 旗下首款摺疊智能手機 iPhone Duo 才剛正式發售數天，社交平台上便陸續傳出內屏幕破裂災情。</p><p>Apple 官方終於正式回應，證實有「少數」 iPhone Duo 裝置的內屏幕受到影響，並建議遭遇問題的消費者聯絡 AppleCare 換機。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T11:42:43.491046+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":137,"images":0,"source":"HKEPC","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T11:34:40+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T01:18:15.237574+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T11:38:18.239608+00:00","content_hash":"3e6da233c0c4ef9f2242f73fca1fddacc8e3a5b378861a1d89b3cbb4cab8dc76","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}